# Secret Safety
.env

# Dependency copies
apm_modules/

# Local / machine-generated settings. NOTE: APM deploys hook wiring to
# .claude/settings.json (project scope) or ~/.claude/settings.json (user scope),
# NOT to *.local.json — so prefer `apm install -g` to keep generated wiring out of
# the repo (see microsoft/apm#1342). This rule still ignores hand-made local overrides.
.claude/*.local.json
